{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】警方在油麻地截查一輛客貨車，車上檢獲懷疑毒品，拘捕一名司機涉嫌販毒。</p>\n<p>司機黑布蒙頭，鎖上手銬，在現場協助調查，緝毒犬亦到場協助。晚上8時許，警員在麗翔道近巧翔街截查一輛可疑客貨車，在車上檢獲懷疑毒品，司機涉嫌販毒被捕。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T15:20:18.776599+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T15:07:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T15:13:54.998623+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T15:13:54.998623+00:00","content_hash":"9c039ce15a5db388abc56867829d0cecd9d874d545b942cf2c212c2bc6ceea4f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}